,{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܸܬ ܙܵܡܪܝܼ ܒܘܼܬ ܐܘܼܪ̈ܚܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܓܘܼܪܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܐܝܼܩܵܪܵܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܪܵܡܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܘܠܟܘܼܦܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܚܵܙܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܪܵܡܵܢܵܐ ܡ̣ܢ ܪܸܚܩܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܝܵܕܹܥ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܸܢ ܚܵܕܪܹܢ ܒܓܵܘܵܐ ܕܥܵܘܩܵܢܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܡܲܚܹܝܬ ܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܟܲܪܒܵܐ ܕܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢܝܼ̈ ܒܸܬ ܦܲܫܛܸܬ ܐܝܼܕܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܸܬ ܦܲܪܩܵܐ ܠܝܼ ܝܲܡܝܼܢܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܬܲܡܸܡ ܟܠܔ ܒܘܼܬ ܕܝܼܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܛܲܝܒܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂ ܠܥܵܠܲܡ ܝܼܠܵܗ̇،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܘܼܠܚܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܐܝܼܕܵܬܘܼ̈ܟ݂ ܠܵܐ ܪܲܦܹܝܬ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/138.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/139.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/137.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}